/*
 * Implements validation and construction of string literal values.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - UTF-8, UTF-16, and UTF-32 string literal encoding,
 *   - escape-sequence processing,
 *   - suffix-based selection of the output character width,
 *   - and construction of slice values containing the encoded characters.
 *
 * Formatted strings are recognized syntactically but are not yet supported.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::literal::string
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/literal/string.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-25
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
